#: ../../../reference/unsafe-comms.md:51
msgid ""
"Weak accesses assume no concurrent access to the addressed locations and "
"omit the encoded memory scope. Relaxed/acquire/release accesses require a "
"scope. Use system scope for the inter-GPU cases described here. Atomic "
"reduction is atomic per accessed element; a whole tile or all participants "
"are not one atomic transaction."
msgstr ""

